WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.062
Episode five: figures, and a second method.

2
00:00:03.062 --> 00:00:10.751
This video assumes APEX installed, as in episode one, and the complete ES-MDA run from episodes two to four.

3
00:00:10.751 --> 00:00:16.655
Run every command below from the APEX folder.

4
00:00:16.655 --> 00:00:19.456
For the figures, we add plots to the report.

5
00:00:19.456 --> 00:00:38.578
They are written as PNG and PDF files in the run's report/ folder.

6
00:00:38.578 --> 00:00:50.781
First metrics/ (the metrics at each step).

7
00:00:50.781 --> 00:01:04.040
Then health/ (the ensemble's spread and the members' data mismatch).

8
00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:18.692
And data/ (the predicted data against the observations, before and after).

9
00:01:18.692 --> 00:01:21.318
Now a second method on the same case.

10
00:01:21.318 --> 00:01:35.669
The example also has GIES, an iterative method, in config_gies.toml, with its own run name (linear_gies).

11
00:01:35.669 --> 00:01:51.013
Its method section names gies, with its own update strategy and schedule.

12
00:01:51.013 --> 00:02:05.350
We run it, to the end this time.

13
00:02:05.350 --> 00:02:28.261
Given a folder, apex summary tabulates every run it finds, so the two methods are side by side.

14
00:02:28.261 --> 00:02:40.644
GIES chooses its number of steps and stops when it has converged (converged), while ES-MDA always takes the number of steps its configuration gives.

15
00:02:40.644 --> 00:02:41.318
Where next?

16
00:02:41.318 --> 00:02:45.671
The web UI and its AI assistant: run the same example from the browser.

17
00:02:45.671 --> 00:02:51.311
The agents from the command line: check, diagnose and report this run with a language model.

18
00:02:51.311 --> 00:02:57.996
Writing a plugin: your own metric or method, run on this example.

19
00:02:57.996 --> 00:03:04.575
So: report with plots writes the figures, and summary of a folder puts its runs side by side.

20
00:03:04.575 --> 00:03:10.529
Next, in episode six: your first optimization.

21
00:03:10.529 --> 00:03:16.029
Thank you for watching.
